From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Pedro Sousa <pedrodsousa@pm.me>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 16:47:36 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Add the upstream LICENSE file to seahash 4.1.0

The crate is MIT but its package has no licence text, so gnrt cannot write
README.chromium and the crate cannot be credited. Upstream added the text
after the 4.1.0 release, in redox-os/seahash commit
3088c5c912b70b586d27bf553fbe964e025a2c89 ("fix: add missing MIT license
text"); this is that file, unchanged.

Aerie: drop this patch once a seahash release ships its LICENSE.
---
 .../vendor/seahash-v4/LICENSE                 | 23 +++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 23 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 third_party/rust/chromium_crates_io/vendor/seahash-v4/LICENSE

diff --git a/third_party/rust/chromium_crates_io/vendor/seahash-v4/LICENSE b/third_party/rust/chromium_crates_io/vendor/seahash-v4/LICENSE
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..31aa793
--- /dev/null
+++ b/third_party/rust/chromium_crates_io/vendor/seahash-v4/LICENSE
@@ -0,0 +1,23 @@
